    [MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure μ] {m n} hn Y h V a b c β hβ hV hY hIndep hMean hMoment hBias l u hlc hcu =>
  anchored_rawEstimator_risk_le μ hn Y h V a b c β hβ hV hY hIndep hMean hMoment hBias (boxClip l u)
